sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as 管理员(页面 /exec-envs)
  participant API as POST /api/admin/exec-envs/register
  participant REG as registry / lifecycle(bgp-execution-envs)
  participant BRK as broker Lambda
  participant CB as CodeBuild(目标区)
  participant RP as redeploy-platform.sh
  U->>API: 新建向导:选区(按账号真值列候选区,SCP 拦截区禁用)、法域、网段
  API->>REG: 写描述符,phase = registered
  API->>BRK: invokeDeployBroker(targetId, operationId)
  BRK->>BRK: 校三白名单(target / 操作 / 栈名前缀)
  BRK->>CB: StartBuild(bgp-exec-env-deploy)
  CB->>CB: pre_build:AZ 探测 · bootstrap · 读源包(控制面部署时的 CDK 资产)
  CB->>CB: build:cdk deploy "BgpExecEnv-<slug>-*"
  CB->>CB: post_build:栈输出回写
  API->>CB: readBuildStatus 轮询(页面「部署进度」)
  U->>API: 「检测初始化」⇒ probe-runner 逐组件探活
  API->>REG: phase = initializing → active(ready)
  U->>RP: 控制面重部署一次放行新区(EXECUTION_REGIONS / aws:RequestedRegion)
  U->>API: 「启用」⇒ 开始承接作业
